WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
is it possible

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:04,400
Is it possible that you still don’t believe me?

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:08,190
Why do you make me believe it?

4
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,340
you really are me

5
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,380
I am really you

6
00:00:12,930 --> 00:00:14,850
No one can change this

7
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:16,610
Then I don’t believe you either, forget it

8
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:17,810
Believe it or not you are there

9
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:19,770
But I believe you will beg me sooner or later

10
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:23,730
Why do I ask you that you are me and I am you?

11
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:26,290
I don't believe you can't feel anything abnormal in your stomach

12
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:27,810
I calculated the time

13
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,970
We haven’t been to Tiankui for three months, right?

14
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,250
It's your fault

15
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:35,560
I don't have this ability

16
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:38,360
It's all thanks to my benefactor

17
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:39,560
your benefactor

18
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:42,640
It's the guy who ran over three months ago

19
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:43,880
without him

20
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,000
I don't even have a chance to come out

21
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:46,680
So when you snatched my body

22
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:48,040
I begged my father for mercy.

23
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,600
Don't just talk about me

24
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:53,510
It's us asking for mercy together, but you don't agree?

25
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:55,870
I can't completely control your body
